WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.620
Who are you?

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.430
You don't need my name.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:10.090
This'll be the last time we meet.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.950
Farewell, Precures!

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.870
This world won't see your light ever again.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:30.370
It belongs to the Selfish now.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.660
Rikka, Alice!

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.150
Great!

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:50.630
Where's Makopi?

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:53.490
The fairies aren't here either.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:17.180
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:19.650
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.520
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:24.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:28.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:35.140
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:40.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:46.460
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:51.880
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:57.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:06.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:08.140
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:10.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:13.380
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.180
What's more than just cute

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:20.050
is our promise between girls

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:26.080
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:31.990
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.430
What <i>is</i> that?

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:43.560
<i>My heart's pounding like a fire alarm!</i>

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.810
<i>We shouldn't be here!</i>

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:46.810
Run, everyone!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.270
There's no need.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.200
Makopi!

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:55.680
King Selfish is currently in a deep slumber.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.120
He won't fight.

00:02:57.550 --> 00:02:59.120
King Selfish?

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.760
How do you know that?

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.900
Who <i>are</i> you?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.720
My name is Cure Sword. {Creative parents, I see.}

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:16.830
I am the final warrior guarding Trump Kingdom.

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:19.670
Trump Kingdom's...

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.390
final warrior?

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:29.770
An Intense Battle!

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:29.770
An Intense Battle!

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:33.680
Mana!

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:34.880
Rikka!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.230
Alice!

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.700
Where are you guys?

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:40.210
Hide!

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.570
Trump Kingdom's already been taken over by the Selfish!

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:49.340
We're done for if they find us!

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:51.470
We fell into the Selfish's trap,

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:53.760
got sent back to Trump Kingdom,

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.850
and now we're separated from Mana and the others!

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:59.140
What should we do?

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.790
Even I don't know!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:04.890
Keep it together!

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.100
Crying won't fix anything.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:12.560
We need to figure out a way home as soon as possible!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.860
Um...

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:14.690
And you are?

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.110
I'm Davi!

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:19.170
Cure Sword's partner!

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:21.370
Nice to meet you, I'm Charles!

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:22.360
I'm Rachel!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.650
I'm Lance!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.600
Save the greetings for later!

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.880
Meeting up with the Precures is our top priority!

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.880
Well, even if it is...

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.320
Just think!

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:35.300
Where would the girls be at a time like this?

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.660
Oh, the Queen's palace!

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:44.080
Oh yeah, it <i>is</i> the biggest landmark here.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.050
Let's go!

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.230
Hey Davi,

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:57.900
how did the Trump Kingdom wear down so quickly?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:03.370
We were sent to the other world as soon as we were born, so we don't know.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:10.160
The Trump Kingdom was a peaceful kingdom.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:17.050
Everyone under Queen Ange's rule lived with a smile.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.390
Have you grown accustomed to the hymn services? {As in, church services. That works for this, right?}

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:43.650
Not quite.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:47.120
I get nervous in front of such a large audience,

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:49.890
so... my words don't come out well.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:55.800
I like your singing.

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.960
When I listen to your voice,

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.440
my heart grows strangely warm.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.410
Thank you for your flattering words, my queen!

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:09.730
There's no need for formality when we're alone.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.310
Right, my queen!

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.970
But one day,

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:26.410
we were suddenly attacked...

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.320
by King Selfish's underlings!

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.890
Selfish!

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.600
But the queen didn't give up hope.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.390
She cut through the enemy lines herself!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.990
Sel... fish! {Squid}

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.170
Lady Cure Sword! {There's no way this isn't meant to sound dumb.}

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:41.070
Lady Cure Sword...

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.590
It's the queen!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.860
The queen...

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:51.380
fought valiantly to seal King Selfish...

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.850
and though she turned his body to stone,

00:07:55.850 --> 00:08:00.500
the dark energy, Egogy, still smolders within him. {"Janejii", seemingly a portmanteau of janen (邪念, wicked mind, like the selfish thoughts that birth a Selfish, and energy. Ego + Energy kind of captures it, I think..}

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.700
I couldn't protect anything...

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.400
Not a thing...

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.470
The queen exhausted all of her power,

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.030
so she's hiding within the palace.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.920
Please, return to her at once!

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:25.240
You're now the only warrior left!

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:32.980
I cannot allow this kingdom's tragedy  to repeat itself!

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:36.360
Please, search for the legendary warriors, the Precures!

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:43.640
No more hide and seek.

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:52.120
Now, offer your soul to King Selfish, too.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.330
Are you all right?

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:03.860
Cure Sword, you came for me.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:08.050
What do you think you can do on your own?

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:10.650
This kingdom is already doomed!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:13.300
A kingdom can always be rebuilt.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:15.770
So long as we do not lose hope!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.740
Cure Sword...

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:19.440
My queen, let's go!

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.040
Shoot!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.060
What's wrong?

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:25.440
The queen jumped into the mirror!

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:27.890
She's not goin' anywhere.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:37.820
My queen!

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.060
Escape, Cure Sword!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:42.990
Even if you're alone!

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.580
You can't give up, my Queen!

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:47.030
Don't let go!

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.230
My queen!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.900
I'll catch up to you, I promise.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.210
That's why you must...

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:06.950
My queen!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:15.010
I lost track of my queen,

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:18.190
and the next thing I knew, I had drifted into your world.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:22.370
Then, the reason you became an idol...

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:24.830
was to find your queen?

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:27.510
I have nothing left but my songs.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.570
If I kept singing,

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:32.770
then surely, that person would take notice.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.190
But I couldn't find {my }her.

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:39.980
No matter what I sing, I've heard nothing from my Queen.

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:48.510
Then let's search for your queen together!

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.830
If you can't find her alone,

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.690
then four people should be enough!

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:53.660
Mana?

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.230
What are you saying?

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:59.100
That Mammo woman was searching for the queen.

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:03.040
So if we find her, I'm sure we'll hear her side of the story.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:09.330
While new Selfishes were being created and running rampant,

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:10.720
they were creating Egogy.

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:16.420
That Egogy is being gathered to revive King Selfish.

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:22.430
But if we can find the queen before he awakens,

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:26.120
we may be able to seal him for good.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.610
Right, see?

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:32.230
Well, if we keep purifying Selfishes,

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:36.470
we'll at least be able to postpone King Selfish's resurrection.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.590
Selfish!

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:52.860
Trump Kingdom is already a Selfish hotbed.

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:56.770
I doubt those little girls can hold out for long...

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:00.970
but it never hurts to make sure.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.350
Get out! {All the frogs say this, but you only need to sub the first frog's "kaere"}{I also just realized that this is a pun on kaere (go home) and kaeru (frog). I am sadly not a good enough translator to capture this pun.}

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.000
Why are there so many?

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.700
All the kingdom's people were turned into Selfishes!

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.100
I'm the only one left!

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.050
Huh?

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:46.420
Getoutgetoutgetout! {When the frogs bump into each other. Sub both sides of the conversation.}

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:46.910
Getoutgetoutgetout!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:50.400
Jump!

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:50.950
Huh?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.080
Nuh-uh, no way, no how!

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:55.390
No can doooo!

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:00.250
Makopi!

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.040
Forget about me!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.740
Escape alone if you have to!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.630
I won't run away!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:25.830
I'll defeat King Selfish,

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.690
and bring peace back to Trump Kingdom!

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.930
What do you think you can do on your own?

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:35.090
She is certainly not alone!

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:37.820
She's just being a happy prince,

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:39.800
so she forgets that we can help, too!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.240
Stop this!

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:44.670
You three have no reason to get involved!

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:47.800
Do you need a reason to help a friend? {Little bit of scriptwriting, but this flows better.}

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.340
<i>But why?</i>

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.680
<i>You don't need a reason to help people!</i>

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.520
<i>She's so determined...</i>

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:00.020
<i>This girl's a strong one...</i>

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.510
Now, lift!

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:11.430
Getoutgetoutgetout!

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:11.900
Look out! {lol cartoon momentum}

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:17.240
Getoutgetoutgetout!

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:19.870
Oh my.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:22.740
Um...

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:24.810
you saved me.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:27.780
Thank you.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.650
Don't mention it!

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:33.360
So, what now?

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:38.010
Returning home seems like a nigh impossible task.

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:40.860
We should at least meet up with the fairies.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.330
There's a magic mirror inside the palace.

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.300
A magic mirror?

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:50.080
It's a warp gate that we used in escaping Trump Kingdom. {I can use warp gate in a children's show for girls, right?}

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:54.870
If we pass through it, we should be able to return to your world once more.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:58.520
The fairies may already be on their way there.

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:00.560
Let's go.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.870
Makopi, guide us through the palace.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.810
There are a lot of mirrors.

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.930
The magic mirror is further in.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.780
Too late.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:40.120
Were you looking for this?

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:41.960
The magic mirror!

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:45.930
This is the sole link between this world and the other.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:50.160
I figured you'd make your way here if you were still alive.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:54.320
You want to fight against <i>me</i>?

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.640
You've got a snowball's chance.

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:59.070
You won't know if you don't try!

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:02.100
Sorry, but it's game over.

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:11.180
Now you'll be stuck here for the rest of your lives.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.090
<i>Our last hope is gone.</i>

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:19.790
<i>I'll never see my queen again!</i>

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:24.210
You may as well rot away with this derelict palace.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.000
Hm hm hm hm hmph...

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.860
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:30.570
Ah ha ha—

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:34.540
Hah hah hah hah hah hah hah hah hahahahahaha!

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:34.540
Huh? {This was all entirely necessary, I'm sure you agree.}

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:40.130
Do you think something so trifling would break our hearts?

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.450
You're sorely mistaken!

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:42.850
What'd you say?

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:46.920
Your power sent us to the Trump Kingdom.

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:54.560
You proved that you have the power to freely go between worlds!

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:56.990
So, if we don't have a mirror,

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:01.030
we can just have you send us back home!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:06.570
You're not telling me to be your yes-man, <i>are</i> you?

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:07.810
Absolutely!

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:10.670
Where's that confidence coming from?

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.410
It comes from being Mana.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:16.680
I can't beat that.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.410
Let's return to our world!

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:20.150
Yeah!

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.810
Guess you'll need some pain to understand.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.530
Mana!

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:29.290
Charles!

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.240
Lance!

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:31.430
Alice!

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:32.110
Rikka!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.600
You're all safe!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:36.000
I thought I'd never see you again!

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:39.180
Davi, I'll never give up again! {or let you down}

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:43.210
I'll fight the Selfish until peace is restored to Trump Kingdom!

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:46.240
Let's go!

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:47.080
Yeah!

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:49.560
Charles!

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:53.780
Precure Love Link!

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:55.530
L-O-V-E!

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:56.300
L-O-V-E!

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:57.050
L-O-V-E!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.120
L-O-V-E!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:25.970
Brimming with love,

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:28.200
Cure Heart!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.320
The light of wisdom,

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:35.730
Cure Diamond!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.270
The warmth of the sun,

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.230
Cure Rosetta!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.060
The blade of courage,

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.260
Cure Sword!

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:55.000
Listen to the heartbeat of love! {alt. "Resound, our throbbing love!"}

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.640
Dokidoki Precure!

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:02.890
Transforming won't change a thing.

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.620
It's the end for you. {That's the third awkwardly worded idiom for "you're going to die" that a Selfish has used this episode.}

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:13.550
Oh, is that a punch?

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:14.670
I thought you were swatting flies.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.840
Your kicks are light.

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:29.180
Rigid Rosetta Wall!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:35.150
Rosetta!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.350
Oh, are you done?

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:39.460
Don't lose hope.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.430
Let's combine our strengths and hearts into one!

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:44.750
Our hearts as one...

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.990
I'll lure him out.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:50.390
Strike him when he's open!

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:50.880
Huh?

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:51.790
Just do it!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.670
Got it.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:57.780
Glitter!

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.680
Holy Sword!

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:04.760
Where are you aiming?

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.380
What?

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:10.920
Now, sparkle!

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.360
Twinkle Diamond!

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:18.530
I can't move!

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:19.730
Now!

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.740
From me to you,

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:31.060
My Sweet Heart!

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:42.510
We did it!

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:47.180
Curse you...

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:49.790
You stole too much of my Egogy...

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.460
He's really stubborn!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:52.760
Everyone, look!

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.500
That's...

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:58.000
The magic mirror is still alive!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:20:59.350
Let's go! {I guess they just forgot about the original plan, but okay.}

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.140
I won't let you run!

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:04.050
We're not running!

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.340
We'll definitely be back!

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:11.050
And we'll rebuild the Trump Kingdom with the queen!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:19.160
Curse you, Precures!

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:23.650
Ow...

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:24.600
We're here!

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:26.800
Looks like we got back somehow.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:32.320
The path to the Trump Kingdom...

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:33.740
Don't worry.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.640
We'll find a way back together.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.960
We've got to find the queen, too.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.630
So we can take back the Trump Kingdom.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:53.580
Please,

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:56.130
lend me your strength.

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:00.530
Let's do this together!

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:28.130
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:31.660
Kyupirappa!

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:31.660
Kyupirappa!

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:33.760
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
